  n = 4, m = 3 tiles, 2^m = 8 tilings
  V = 4 iso classes = A000568(4) = #even graphs(4)
  SC = 2, V_merged = 3 = (V+SC)/2 = (4+2)/2 = 3
############################################################

  BLUE/BLACK LINES:
    Blue tilings: 4 (grid-symmetric)
    Black tilings: 4
    Blue fraction: 0.500000
    Unmerged complement edges: 1 (= (V-SC)/2 = 1)
    SC (self-complement) classes: 2
    In merged graph: ALL blue/black lines become self-loops

  WIGGLY LINES:
    Total wiggly transitions: 24
    Wiggly self-loops (labeled): 10
    Unmerged wiggly edges: 5
    Merged wiggly edges: 3

  THE PARALLEL:
    Blue/black nodes: 4 unmerged, 3 merged
    Wiggly nodes: 4 unmerged, 3 merged
    Same node set? YES (both = A000568(4) = #even_graphs(4))

  OVERLAP (unmerged):
    Blue/black edges: 1
    Wiggly edges: 5
    Overlap: 0
    Complement reachable by single flip? NO

  COMBINED UNMERGED GRAPH:
    Vertices: 4
    Blue/black edges: 1
    Wiggly edges: 5
    Total unique edges: 6
    Blue/black adds 1 new edges beyond wiggly

  CONNECTIVITY:
    Wiggly-only connected? True (reaches 4/4)
    Blue/black-only connected? False (reaches 1/4)
    Both needed for full connectivity? False

  GRAPH DENSITY:
    Blue/black: 1/6 = 0.1667
    Wiggly: 5/6 = 0.8333
    Combined: 6/6 = 1.0000

  DEGREE COMPARISON:
    Wiggly: min=2, max=3, avg=2.5
    Blue/black: min=1, max=1, avg=1.0
    (Blue/black is a matching: every non-SC node has degree 1, SC nodes have degree 0)

  Time: 0.0s

